---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: check position.vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_none: no vesting contract deployed
    q_revert_none --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_check_vesting --> q_call_release: vesting contract exists
    q_call_release --> q_calc_vested: calculate vestedAmount based on elapsed time and schedule
    q_calc_vested --> q_check_releasable: releasable = vestedAmount - alreadyReleased
    q_check_releasable --> q_revert_zero: releasable == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_check_releasable --> q_transfer: releasable > 0
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, releasable), emit VestedTokensReleased

    note right of q_calc_vested
        INV-001: vested amount increases linearly over vesting duration
        INV-002: total released never exceeds total allocation
    end note
